The softcore is generated from the tinyduino project (a semester thesis of Domenic Wüthrich)
https://gitlab.ethz.ch/ElectronicsForPhysicists2/tinyduino

It is based on the VexRiscv project from Charles Papon
https://github.com/SpinalHDL/VexRiscv

The code from the tinyduino project was modified and compiled to generate system.v

The adaptations are made by Yves Acremann


